IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `claq-dates`
IMPORT `claq-abuse`

-- Civil Liability Act 2003 (Queensland) -- worked cases for the claimant's questions in claq-abuse.l4 (chapter 2,
-- part 2A). Every expected value is worked by hand from the deposited text, never copied from the encoding's output.
