§ `Cases: claims against institutions for child abuse`

-- ===================================================================================================================
§§ `ss 33A, 33C`
-- ===================================================================================================================

#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `sexual abuse` TRUE `an officer, office holder, representative, leader, owner, member, employee, agent, volunteer or contractor of it` TRUE EQUALS `yes: my claim is an abuse claim under part 2A (s 33A)`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `serious physical abuse` TRUE `a minister of religion, religious leader or member of the personnel of it, a religious organisation` TRUE EQUALS `yes: my claim is an abuse claim under part 2A (s 33A)`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `psychological abuse in connection with sexual abuse or serious physical abuse` TRUE `an individual to whom it delegated care, supervision, control or authority over me, or such a person of a delegate entity` TRUE EQUALS `yes: my claim is an abuse claim under part 2A (s 33A)`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `psychological abuse alone, or other harm` TRUE `an officer, office holder, representative, leader, owner, member, employee, agent, volunteer or contractor of it` TRUE EQUALS `no: what was done is not abuse as part 2A defines it (s 33A)`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `sexual abuse` FALSE `an officer, office holder, representative, leader, owner, member, employee, agent, volunteer or contractor of it` TRUE EQUALS `no: a family is not an institution, nor is an entity whose activities give no opportunity for contact with a child (s 33A)`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `sexual abuse` TRUE `an officer, office holder, representative, leader, owner, member, employee, agent, volunteer or contractor of it` FALSE EQUALS `no: I was not under the institution's care, supervision, control or authority at the time (s 33A)`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `sexual abuse` TRUE `my long-term guardian under a child protection order, and nothing more` TRUE EQUALS `no: a person is not associated with the institution only because of a long-term guardianship order (s 33C(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `sexual abuse` TRUE `connected to it only through an entity it funds or regulates` TRUE EQUALS `no: a person is not associated with the institution only because they are associated with an entity it funds or regulates (s 33C(3))`
#ASSERT `Is my claim an abuse claim` `sexual abuse` TRUE `someone else` TRUE EQUALS `not covered: s 33C lists those associated with an institution without closing the list; whether this person is associated is for the court`

-- ===================================================================================================================
§§ `ss 33D, 33E, 86`
-- ===================================================================================================================

#ASSERT `Must I prove the institution was at fault` `sexual abuse` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no: the institution is taken to have breached its duty to prevent the abuse unless it proves it took all reasonable steps (s 33E(2))`
#ASSERT `Must I prove the institution was at fault` `serious physical abuse` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `no breach under s 33D: the institution proved it took all reasonable steps to prevent the abuse (s 33E(2))`
-- s 33A(a): for division 2, psychological abuse is not abuse, even in connection with sexual abuse.
#ASSERT `Must I prove the institution was at fault` `psychological abuse in connection with sexual abuse or serious physical abuse` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 33E does not apply: division 2 covers only sexual abuse or serious physical abuse (s 33A(a))`
#ASSERT `Must I prove the institution was at fault` `sexual abuse` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 33E does not apply: the abuse happened before division 2 of part 2A commenced (s 86); the general law of negligence decides`
#ASSERT `Must I prove the institution was at fault` `sexual abuse` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 33E does not apply: my claim is not an abuse claim by a person associated with the institution while I was in its care`

-- ===================================================================================================================
§§ `ss 33F-33I`
-- (arguments: incorporated now, unincorporated then, claim against former office holder, still in office,
-- nominee)
-- ===================================================================================================================

-- s 33F: a club incorporated since the abuse.
`the club now incorporated` MEANS `Whom can I sue for the abuse` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the club now incorporated`'s `the institution itself`
#ASSERT `the club now incorporated`'s `the institution, for the liability of a former office holder (s 33F)`
#ASSERT NOT (`the club now incorporated`'s `the current holder of the office, in the name of the office (s 33G)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the club now incorporated`'s `the institution's nominee (s 33I)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the club now incorporated`'s `my notice of claim goes to the head of the institution (s 33H(3))`)
-- s 33G, s 33H, s 33I: a still-unincorporated church whose bishop of the time has gone, with a nominee.
`the church still unincorporated` MEANS `Whom can I sue for the abuse` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `the church still unincorporated`'s `the institution itself`
#ASSERT NOT (`the church still unincorporated`'s `the institution, for the liability of a former office holder (s 33F)`)
#ASSERT `the church still unincorporated`'s `the current holder of the office, in the name of the office (s 33G)`
#ASSERT `the church still unincorporated`'s `the institution's nominee (s 33I)`
#ASSERT `the church still unincorporated`'s `my notice of claim goes to the head of the institution (s 33H(3))`
-- s 33G(1)(e): the former office holder still holds the office; no nominee.
#ASSERT NOT ((`Whom can I sue for the abuse` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)'s `the current holder of the office, in the name of the office (s 33G)`)
#ASSERT NOT ((`Whom can I sue for the abuse` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)'s `the institution's nominee (s 33I)`)

-- ===================================================================================================================
§§ `s 33H(5), (6)`
-- ===================================================================================================================

-- Started 1 January 2026: 31 days to 1 February, 59 to 1 March, 90 to 1 April, 120 to 1 May 2026.
#ASSERT `From what day may I apply for a trustee nominee` (`the calendar day` 1 1 2026) EQUALS `the calendar day` 1 5 2026
#ASSERT `May I apply for a trustee to be made the nominee` TRUE (`the calendar day` 1 1 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 5 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `yes: I may apply, and the court may order it if satisfied the trust is or was an associated trust and the order is appropriate (s 33H(6))`
#ASSERT `May I apply for a trustee to be made the nominee` TRUE (`the calendar day` 1 1 2026) (`the calendar day` 30 4 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not yet: 120 days have not passed since my proceeding was started (s 33H(5)(a))`
#ASSERT `May I apply for a trustee to be made the nominee` TRUE (`the calendar day` 1 1 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no: the institution has a nominee and the court is not satisfied it lacks sufficient assets (s 33H(5)(b))`
#ASSERT `May I apply for a trustee to be made the nominee` TRUE (`the calendar day` 1 1 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS `yes: I may apply, and the court may order it if satisfied the trust is or was an associated trust and the order is appropriate (s 33H(6))`
#ASSERT `May I apply for a trustee to be made the nominee` FALSE (`the calendar day` 1 1 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no: s 33H applies only to an unincorporated institution (s 33H(1))`
-- Across a leap day: started 1 February 2028; 29 days to 1 March, 120 days to 31 May 2028.
#ASSERT `From what day may I apply for a trustee nominee` (`the calendar day` 1 2 2028) EQUALS `the calendar day` 31 5 2028

-- ===================================================================================================================
§§ `s 33H(7)`
-- (the regulative rule)
-- ===================================================================================================================

-- An order of 1 March 2026 allowing 28 days: the last day is 29 March 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must the institution identify its trusts` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 28 EQUALS `the calendar day` 29 3 2026
#ASSERT `Has the institution identified its trusts in time` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 28 TRUE (`the calendar day` 29 3 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `yes: the institution complied within the period the order allowed (s 33H(7)(a))`
#ASSERT `Has the institution identified its trusts in time` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 28 TRUE (`the calendar day` 30 3 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `no: the institution complied, but after the period the order allowed ended (s 33H(7)(a)); the court may make further orders`
#ASSERT `Has the institution identified its trusts in time` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 28 TRUE (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `yes: the institution complied within the period the order allowed (s 33H(7)(a))`
#ASSERT `Has the institution identified its trusts in time` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 28 FALSE (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) (`the calendar day` 29 3 2026) EQUALS `not yet due: the institution has not complied, but the period has not ended`
#ASSERT `Has the institution identified its trusts in time` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 28 FALSE (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) (`the calendar day` 30 3 2026) EQUALS `no: the period the order allowed has ended and the institution has not complied (s 33H(7)(a)); the court may make further orders`
-- "any other period the court considers appropriate": 14 days, last day 15 March 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must the institution identify its trusts` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 14 EQUALS `the calendar day` 15 3 2026
#ASSERT `Has the institution identified its trusts in time` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 14 TRUE (`the calendar day` 15 3 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `yes: the institution complied within the period the order allowed (s 33H(7)(a))`
#ASSERT `Has the institution identified its trusts in time` (`the calendar day` 1 3 2026) 14 TRUE (`the calendar day` 16 3 2026) (`the calendar day` 1 6 2026) EQUALS `no: the institution complied, but after the period the order allowed ended (s 33H(7)(a)); the court may make further orders`

-- ===================================================================================================================
§§ `ss 33B, 33J-33MA`
-- ===================================================================================================================

#ASSERT `Is this trust an associated trust` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Is this trust an associated trust` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Is this trust an associated trust` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is this trust an associated trust` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is this trust an associated trust` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `Is this trust an associated trust` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `What can my judgment or settlement be paid from` `the institution` EQUALS `the assets of the institution and of its associated trusts, including my costs (ss 33J, 33MA)`
#ASSERT `What can my judgment or settlement be paid from` `the institution's nominee, which is the trustee of an associated trust` EQUALS `the assets of the associated trust and of the institution, the trustee's own liability being limited to the value of the trust property, including my costs (ss 33K(2), 33M(4), 33MA)`
#ASSERT `What can my judgment or settlement be paid from` `the institution's nominee, which is not such a trustee` EQUALS `the nominee's own assets and the assets of the institution, including my costs (ss 33K(3), 33MA)`
#ASSERT `What can my judgment or settlement be paid from` `the current holder of the office` EQUALS `the assets of the institution and of its associated trusts, not the office holder's own assets, including my costs (ss 33L, 33MA)`
